OL,3,GNEWSAAttempted murder arrest after
OL,4,Acrash on M4
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fattempted murder after two collisions
OL,8,Fon a busy motorway interchange.
OL,10,FAvon and Somerset Police said they were
OL,11,Fcalled to the meeting point of the M4
OL,12,Fand M5 motorways at the Almondsbury
OL,13,FInterchange, near Bristol, at
OL,14,Fapproximately 21:00 BST on Wednesday.
OL,16,FPolice said they were initially called
OL,17,Fto reports of a car colliding with the
OL,18,Fcentral reservation on the M5
OL,19,Fnorthbound, before the driver got out
OL,20,Fof his vehicle and there was a further
OL,21,Fcollision involving two vehicles on the
OL,22,FM4.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
